# ----------------------------
# Phase-1 template MVP cleanup
# ----------------------------

# Keep the real README (we are NOT ignoring it)
!README.md

# Template-only / legacy folder (you showed it exists in template-mvp)
master/

# Template readme (you should eventually rename/move it, not keep both)
TEMPLATE_README.md

# Template slide deck files (keep YOUR final deck, usually named presentation.pdf)
DS_Project_Presentation_Template.pdf
# If DS_Project_Presentation.pdf is only the template placeholder, uncomment next line:
# DS_Project_Presentation.pdf

# Keep the required final presentation PDF (many curricula require this exact name)
!presentation.pdf

